OL,3,GNEWSAMother begs council to keep
OL,4,Aswimming pool open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 67-year-old said swimming provided
OL,7,Fthe only cardiovascular exercise he
OL,8,Fcould do and gave him a sense of
OL,9,Ffreedom, adding: "If I've got breath in
OL,10,Fmy body, I'll fight for him."
